            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'm pretty sure a few people use it. But still, I'm on your team. This keymap is literally a landmine that can alter the whole screen with a directory plugin. Maybe I have sausage fingers or something, but I accidentally press it occasionally. So I disabled it:\n\n```vim\n:nn - -\n```\n\n```lua\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"-\", \"-\")\n```",
